offence under s 394
===================

4 ways this can be satisfied.

  1. If any person, in committing or in attempting to commit commits robbery OF f f's voluntarily causes hurt f's such person
  2. If any person, in committing or in attempting to commit commits robbery OF f f's voluntarily causes hurt f's any other person jointly concerned in committing or attempting to commit such robbery
  3. If any person, in committing or in attempting to commit f's attempting to commit robbery f's voluntarily causes hurt f's such person
  4. If any person, in committing or in attempting to commit f's attempting to commit robbery f's voluntarily causes hurt f's any other person jointly concerned in committing or attempting to commit such robbery
